# Two groups of six on perpendicular paths through open ground.
# Catches vertex collisions where there is room to be wrong quietly: with space
# on all sides a bad plan still looks plausible, which is exactly when nobody
# notices.
version 1
map hall.map
tick 0.016666667
agent 0 1 3
agent 1 1 4
agent 2 1 5
agent 3 2 3
agent 4 2 4
agent 5 2 5
agent 6 3 1
agent 7 4 1
agent 8 5 1
agent 9 3 2
agent 10 4 2
agent 11 5 2
order 0 0,1,2,3,4,5 10 4
order 0 6,7,8,9,10,11 4 10
end 250
